{"seq":3,"slug":"power-integrity","title":"电源完整性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/pcb-design/signal-integrity-pcb/power-integrity","wordCount":1550,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"电源完整性\">电源完整性</h1><p>电源完整性（Power Integrity, PI）确保 PCB 上所有 IC 在任何工作状态下都能获得稳定、低噪声的电源供给。电源分配网络（PDN）的阻抗特性直接影响信号完整性——一个噪声过大的电源会使信号眼图退化、时序裕量缩小。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>电源完整性（PI）</strong>：确保所有 IC 在任何工作状态下都获得稳定、低噪声的电源供给</li>\n<li><strong>PDN（电源分配网络）</strong>：从 VRM 到 IC 片上的完整供电路径，其阻抗随频率变化</li>\n<li><strong>目标阻抗 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z_{target}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong>：所有频率下 PDN 阻抗必须低于的限值，由允许纹波与瞬态电流决定</li>\n<li><strong>去耦电容</strong>：在 IC 切换瞬间提供局部电荷，有效性取决于电容值及安装环路电感</li>\n<li><strong>平面电容</strong>：相邻 PWR/GND 平面构成的天然平板电容，在超高频段提供低阻抗路径</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"pdn-基本概念\">PDN 基本概念</h2><h3 id=\"电源分配网络构成\">电源分配网络构成</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[VRM 稳压器] --&gt; B[大电容&lt;br&gt;100-1000μF]&#10;    B --&gt; C[中电容&lt;br&gt;1-10μF]&#10;    C --&gt; D[小电容&lt;br&gt;10-100nF]&#10;    D --&gt; E[IC 内部电容&lt;br&gt;Die Cap]&#10;    A --&gt; F[PCB 走线/平面]&#10;    F --&gt; G[过孔]&#10;    G --&gt; H[BGA 焊球]&#10;    H --&gt; E\">graph LR\n    A[VRM 稳压器] --&gt; B[大电容&lt;br&gt;100-1000μF]\n    B --&gt; C[中电容&lt;br&gt;1-10μF]\n    C --&gt; D[小电容&lt;br&gt;10-100nF]\n    D --&gt; E[IC 内部电容&lt;br&gt;Die Cap]\n    A --&gt; F[PCB 走线/平面]\n    F --&gt; G[过孔]\n    G --&gt; H[BGA 焊球]\n    H --&gt; E</pre><p>PDN 各段的频率覆盖范围：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>PDN 组件</th>\n<th>有效频率范围</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>VRM 稳压器</td>\n<td>DC – 100kHz</td>\n<td>提供稳态电流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大容量电容(Bulk)</td>\n<td>10kHz – 1MHz</td>\n<td>补偿负载瞬变</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中容量电容(Mid)</td>\n<td>100kHz – 50MHz</td>\n<td>过渡频段去耦</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>小容量MLCC</td>\n<td>1MHz – 500MHz</td>\n<td>高频去耦</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PCB 平面电容</td>\n<td>100MHz – 1GHz</td>\n<td>超高频去耦</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IC 片上电容</td>\n<td>&gt;500MHz</td>\n<td>最高频响应</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"目标阻抗法\">目标阻抗法</h3><p>PDN 设计的核心指标是目标阻抗——在所有频率下，从 IC 电源引脚看进去的 PDN 阻抗必须低于目标值：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z_{target} = \\frac{V_{DD} \\times Ripple\\%}{I_{transient}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.263em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">ppl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\">%</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>示例：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{DD}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> = 1.0V，允许纹波 3%，瞬态电流 5A：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1.0</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>0.03</mn></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mtext> m</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z_{target} = \\frac{1.0 \\times 0.03}{5} = 6 \\text{ m}\\Omega</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1.0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.03</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> m</span></span><span class=\"mord\">Ω</span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"去耦电容设计\">去耦电容设计</h2><h3 id=\"去耦原理\">去耦原理</h3><p>去耦电容在 IC 切换瞬间提供局部电荷，避免电压跌落。其有效性取决于电容自身及安装环路的总阻抗。</p>\n<h3 id=\"电容选型\">电容选型</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>容值</th>\n<th>封装</th>\n<th>自谐振频率</th>\n<th>有效频段</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>100μF</td>\n<td>电解/钽</td>\n<td>~100kHz</td>\n<td>DC-500kHz</td>\n<td>Bulk 储能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10μF</td>\n<td>0805 MLCC</td>\n<td>~2MHz</td>\n<td>500kHz-10MHz</td>\n<td>中频去耦</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1μF</td>\n<td>0402 MLCC</td>\n<td>~8MHz</td>\n<td>2-30MHz</td>\n<td>中频去耦</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>100nF</td>\n<td>0402 MLCC</td>\n<td>~30MHz</td>\n<td>10-100MHz</td>\n<td>标准去耦</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10nF</td>\n<td>0201 MLCC</td>\n<td>~100MHz</td>\n<td>50-300MHz</td>\n<td>高频去耦</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1nF</td>\n<td>0201 MLCC</td>\n<td>~300MHz</td>\n<td>100MHz-1GHz</td>\n<td>超高频去耦</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"去耦电容放置规则\">去耦电容放置规则</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>规则</th>\n<th>要求</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>距离最近</td>\n<td>紧贴 IC 电源引脚</td>\n<td>减小安装环路电感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>回流最短</td>\n<td>电容接地端就近过孔</td>\n<td>降低环路面积</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多容值组合</td>\n<td>覆盖全频段</td>\n<td>各频段阻抗均达标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>扇形布置</td>\n<td>围绕 IC 均匀分布</td>\n<td>各引脚等距离供电</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Via-in-pad</td>\n<td>电容焊盘直接过孔到平面</td>\n<td>最小化安装电感</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"安装电感的影响\">安装电感的影响</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[去耦电容等效电路] --&gt; B[ESR 等效串联电阻]&#10;    A --&gt; C[ESL 等效串联电感]&#10;    A --&gt; D[C 电容值]&#10;    E[安装环路] --&gt; F[焊盘到过孔走线]&#10;    E --&gt; G[过孔本身电感]&#10;    E --&gt; H[平面扩散电感]&#10;    I[总有效电感] --&gt; C&#10;    I --&gt; F&#10;    I --&gt; G&#10;    I --&gt; H&#10;    I --&gt; J[决定自谐振频率&lt;br&gt;和高频阻抗]\">graph TD\n    A[去耦电容等效电路] --&gt; B[ESR 等效串联电阻]\n    A --&gt; C[ESL 等效串联电感]\n    A --&gt; D[C 电容值]\n    E[安装环路] --&gt; F[焊盘到过孔走线]\n    E --&gt; G[过孔本身电感]\n    E --&gt; H[平面扩散电感]\n    I[总有效电感] --&gt; C\n    I --&gt; F\n    I --&gt; G\n    I --&gt; H\n    I --&gt; J[决定自谐振频率&lt;br&gt;和高频阻抗]</pre><p>安装电感典型值：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>安装方式</th>\n<th>环路电感</th>\n<th>评价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>走线连接(10mil走线)</td>\n<td>1.0–2.0nH</td>\n<td>差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>短走线+过孔</td>\n<td>0.5–1.0nH</td>\n<td>一般</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Via-in-pad</td>\n<td>0.2–0.5nH</td>\n<td>良好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>嵌入式电容</td>\n<td>&lt;0.1nH</td>\n<td>最优</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"电源平面设计\">电源平面设计</h2><h3 id=\"平面电容利用\">平面电容利用</h3><p>相邻的 PWR 和 GND 平面构成天然平板电容：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>ε</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>ε</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>×</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow><mi>d</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{plane} = \\frac{\\varepsilon_r \\times \\varepsilon_0 \\times A}{d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>示例：FR4(<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ε</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>=4.4)，面积 100mm×100mm，间距 0.1mm：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4.4</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>8.85</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></msup><mo>×</mo><mn>0.01</mn></mrow><mn>0.0001</mn></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>3.9</mn><mtext> nF</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{plane} = \\frac{4.4 \\times 8.85 \\times 10^{-12} \\times 0.01}{0.0001} \\approx 3.9 \\text{ nF}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">an</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1771em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.0001</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4.4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8.85</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">12</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.01</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.9</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> nF</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>该电容在 100MHz–1GHz 频段提供低阻抗路径。</p>\n<h3 id=\"电源平面分割策略\">电源平面分割策略</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>注意事项</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>整面单一电压</td>\n<td>单电源系统</td>\n<td>最佳 PI 性能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分割平面</td>\n<td>多电压域</td>\n<td>分割线下方禁走高速信号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>铜皮供电</td>\n<td>局部小电流域</td>\n<td>线宽满足电流要求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>嵌入式电源层</td>\n<td>超薄介质</td>\n<td>增大平面电容</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"分割平面的回流问题\">分割平面的回流问题</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>影响</th>\n<th>解决方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>信号跨越分割线</td>\n<td>回流中断，EMI 激增</td>\n<td>避免信号跨越或加桥接电容</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分割线处缝隙辐射</td>\n<td>EMC 超标</td>\n<td>分割线两侧缝合(Stitching)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>边缘辐射</td>\n<td>平面谐振</td>\n<td>20H 规则(平面内缩)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"电源完整性仿真\">电源完整性仿真</h2><h3 id=\"pdn-仿真流程\">PDN 仿真流程</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>定义目标阻抗</td>\n<td>手工计算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>建立 PDN 网络模型</td>\n<td>SPICE / PI 仿真器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>频域阻抗分析</td>\n<td>Z(f) 曲线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>调整去耦方案</td>\n<td>优化电容配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>时域瞬态验证</td>\n<td>负载阶跃响应</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>IR-Drop 分析</td>\n<td>DC 压降分布</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"dc-ir-drop-分析\">DC IR-Drop 分析</h3><p>DC IR-Drop 评估电源从 VRM 到 IC 引脚的直流压降：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>检查点</th>\n<th>允许压降</th>\n<th>超标处理</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>VRM 输出到焊盘</td>\n<td>≤1% VDD</td>\n<td>加宽走线/增加过孔</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平面到 BGA 焊球</td>\n<td>≤2% VDD</td>\n<td>优化过孔分布</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>总 DC Drop</td>\n<td>≤3% VDD</td>\n<td>调整叠层或电源走线</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"ac-纹波分析\">AC 纹波分析</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>频率范围</th>\n<th>纹波来源</th>\n<th>允许幅度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>DC–1kHz</td>\n<td>负载阶跃</td>\n<td>≤3% VDD</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1kHz–1MHz</td>\n<td>开关纹波</td>\n<td>≤1% VDD</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1MHz–1GHz</td>\n<td>SSN(同步开关噪声)</td>\n<td>≤5% VDD</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"电源完整性测量\">电源完整性测量</h2><h3 id=\"测量方法\">测量方法</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>测量内容</th>\n<th>设备</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>近场探针</td>\n<td>PDN 阻抗 Z(f)</td>\n<td>VNA + 探针</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>示波器探测</td>\n<td>时域纹波</td>\n<td>高带宽差分探头</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>频谱分析</td>\n<td>电源频谱</td>\n<td>频谱仪 + 近场探针</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>红外热像</td>\n<td>电流密度分布</td>\n<td>红外相机</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"测量注意事项\">测量注意事项</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>要点</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>探头接地环</td>\n<td>必须使用弹簧接地环，禁用长地线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测量带宽</td>\n<td>探头带宽 ≥ 关注频率 3×</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测量位置</td>\n<td>尽量靠近 IC 电源引脚</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>负载条件</td>\n<td>在最大瞬态负载下测量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>环境温度</td>\n<td>记录测量时温度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>电源完整性是高速系统可靠工作的基础。从 PDN 阻抗设计到去耦电容优化，从平面规划到仿真验证，PI 工程确保每个芯片在最苛刻的切换瞬间都能获得干净稳定的电源。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>PDN 设计以目标阻抗为核心指标，各频段阻抗都必须低于限值</li>\n<li>去耦电容按容值组合覆盖全频段，安装环路电感决定其高频有效性</li>\n<li>电源平面分割要兼顾多电压域供电与回流连续，分割处须加桥接电容</li>\n<li>仿真以 Z(f) 阻抗曲线为主线，时域瞬态与 IR-Drop 分析做验证</li>\n<li>测量须用弹簧接地环靠近 IC 引脚，在最大瞬态负载下进行</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"电源完整性","id":"电源完整性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"PDN 基本概念","id":"pdn-基本概念"},{"level":3,"text":"电源分配网络构成","id":"电源分配网络构成"},{"level":3,"text":"目标阻抗法","id":"目标阻抗法"},{"level":2,"text":"去耦电容设计","id":"去耦电容设计"},{"level":3,"text":"去耦原理","id":"去耦原理"},{"level":3,"text":"电容选型","id":"电容选型"},{"level":3,"text":"去耦电容放置规则","id":"去耦电容放置规则"},{"level":3,"text":"安装电感的影响","id":"安装电感的影响"},{"level":2,"text":"电源平面设计","id":"电源平面设计"},{"level":3,"text":"平面电容利用","id":"平面电容利用"},{"level":3,"text":"电源平面分割策略","id":"电源平面分割策略"},{"level":3,"text":"分割平面的回流问题","id":"分割平面的回流问题"},{"level":2,"text":"电源完整性仿真","id":"电源完整性仿真"},{"level":3,"text":"PDN 仿真流程","id":"pdn-仿真流程"},{"level":3,"text":"DC IR-Drop 分析","id":"dc-ir-drop-分析"},{"level":3,"text":"AC 纹波分析","id":"ac-纹波分析"},{"level":2,"text":"电源完整性测量","id":"电源完整性测量"},{"level":3,"text":"测量方法","id":"测量方法"},{"level":3,"text":"测量注意事项","id":"测量注意事项"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"高速信号走线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/pcb-design/signal-integrity-pcb/high-speed-signal-routing"},"next":{"title":"DFM 设计规范","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/pcb-design/manufacturing-testing/dfm-design-rules"}}